                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For the past 14 years, the Affordable Care Act has provided tens of millions of Americans with health care they otherwise wouldn't be able to afford.\n\nDemocrats have built on the ACA, lowering premiums and drug prices.\n\nRepublicans are threatening to take it all away.",
