                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Alzheimer's is an unforgiving disease, and more than 30,000 people aged 65 and older in Hawai\u2018i are living with it.\n\nToday I talked with HI reps from @alzassociation about how we can keep working together to bolster research and help support Alzheimer's patients & their families. https://t.co/ajrPwkU6cA",
