                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Dreamers all across the country\u2014including in Hawai\u2018i\u2014deserve health care like the rest of us. More than a third of them currently lack coverage, and I\u2019m glad they\u2019ll be able to enroll through the ACA Marketplaces.\n\nThanks to @SenatorDurbin @SenBooker for leading on this issue.",
