                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "They don\u2019t care about your hospitals, or your schools, or your roads. They don\u2019t care about the 30% of federal workers who are veterans or that families can\u2019t afford health care.\n\nThe only thing they are focused on right now is cutting taxes for billionaires. https://t.co/5XfoWNWMrl",
